{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/186eada22eb07d067255a10939b7c8d1.webp?t=1770070025\" width=616 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kavel is an accessible arcade-puzzle game. Tetrominos from classic block games together with your favorite match-3 obsession make this a fresh new puzzle experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/6effd10777c1cab5d6c2712028219420.poster.avif?t=1770070025\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/6effd10777c1cab5d6c2712028219420.webm?t=1770070025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/6effd10777c1cab5d6c2712028219420.mp4?t=1770070025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate and drag the Tetromino to place it onto the puzzle grid. Release to create the match. Watch the score rack up and the board adapt. An endless possibility space where you can test your mettle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt for the highest score among your friends or attempt the challenge of the long list of achievements. There's something here for everyone. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/1cfda338162a5d52cfa33766087dd4d5.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>THREE SEPARATE GAME MODE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CASUAL MODE <br>Take your time, plan your strategies and execute at your own pace. The next 50 shapes are yours to command. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FRENZY MODE <br>The pressure is on! The next 90 seconds are a frantic mad dash straight to the top of score mountain. No time to think, only to rise to the challenge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZEN MODE <br>Feeling the stress of the day? Is the weather getting you down? Boring meeting? This is where you zone out. There is no end, no obligations, this is digital bubble wrap. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/338318cf7340fe6ae125b3fa50cc216e.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>FRESH BUT FAMILIAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kavel is a game that seems familiar but is in fact a truly unique and fresh matching experience. New gameplay ideas to challenge you with some of the play elements that you already know. Let yourself be surprised. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/f4cf8fc9dbeb8118586c633c2af2d4df.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>DESIGNED FOR LONGEVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to play, hard to master. A layered score system, designed to engage you time after time as you learn the subtleties of storming the leaderboards. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/5ac0dd2b1c76030e4fe8521d11f7094f.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>ACHIEVEMENTS AND LEADERBOARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full integration of achievements and leaderboards. Carefully designed achievements to playfully teach and surprise you. Approaching play from new perspectives. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/cfb61ab358ed8527b30de355e7728efe.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>BEAUTIFUL COLOR PALETTES - INCLUDING DARK MODE PALETTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style Kavel the way you like, all themes are created and perfected for an optimal play experience. Dip your finger in the paint and let's go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/18b20770e83af3e0e5404408606b955c.poster.avif?t=1770070025\" width=616 height=517 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/18b20770e83af3e0e5404408606b955c.webm?t=1770070025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/1cfda338162a5d52cfa33766087dd4d5.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>PLAYFUL DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal design language for optimal play experience. Instantly take in the puzzle board for split second decisions. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/338318cf7340fe6ae125b3fa50cc216e.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>BESPOKE AUDIO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and lively audio experience that really pops. With music specially composed for Kavel to support the game's varied modes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/f4cf8fc9dbeb8118586c633c2af2d4df.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>OPTIMIZED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs smoothly on every device. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/5ac0dd2b1c76030e4fe8521d11f7094f.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>COLORBLIND-FRIENDLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not rely on color and is playable with any form of color blindness. Further includes multiple color palettes optimized for any form of color blindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kavel was humbly inspired by games I love such as Tetris, Lumines and Bejeweled (Blitz)</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Frenzy Journeyman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/e89b81a17245f564cd44feff231414360bf3807e.jpg"},{"name":"Frenzy Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/62992146e5d0ae609c37f1a718b5c757b80123c7.jpg"},{"name":"Frenzy Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/d8f46c2d214fdbcd1b7d7899848839ee602e2e87.jpg"},{"name":"Frenzy Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/ff96c0c79fd9da779090a9a54c7aaf17e82f7743.jpg"},{"name":"Casual Journeyman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/c82cfabd09bcb7ffbe95d0ffc88d0742e4605c47.jpg"},{"name":"Casual Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/e496e6352ba12fc373cbd4aad4e528cc991a5ec0.jpg"},{"name":"Casual Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/9c357fb51a06dc9261df60c988d200cdbec0ac9b.jpg"},{"name":"Casual Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/18e25be921a038e38b61162d12f9cb9c09e3afe7.jpg"},{"name":"Lethal Weapon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/f7a35b69efa2dd4976aed58e52bcbf66cd96e1c6.jpg"},{"name":"Bomber Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1414530/2dd0ef5c6810a661d31de001cd4c4c75b9a8968b.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1414530?t=1770070025","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770070025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770070025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770070025","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/186eada22eb07d067255a10939b7c8d1.webp?t=1770070025\" width=616 height=12 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kavel is an accessible arcade-puzzle game. Tetrominos from classic block games together with your favorite match-3 obsession make this a fresh new puzzle experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/6effd10777c1cab5d6c2712028219420.poster.avif?t=1770070025\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/6effd10777c1cab5d6c2712028219420.webm?t=1770070025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/6effd10777c1cab5d6c2712028219420.mp4?t=1770070025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate and drag the Tetromino to place it onto the puzzle grid. Release to create the match. Watch the score rack up and the board adapt. An endless possibility space where you can test your mettle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt for the highest score among your friends or attempt the challenge of the long list of achievements. There's something here for everyone. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/1cfda338162a5d52cfa33766087dd4d5.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>THREE SEPARATE GAME MODE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CASUAL MODE <br>Take your time, plan your strategies and execute at your own pace. The next 50 shapes are yours to command. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FRENZY MODE <br>The pressure is on! The next 90 seconds are a frantic mad dash straight to the top of score mountain. No time to think, only to rise to the challenge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZEN MODE <br>Feeling the stress of the day? Is the weather getting you down? Boring meeting? This is where you zone out. There is no end, no obligations, this is digital bubble wrap. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/338318cf7340fe6ae125b3fa50cc216e.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>FRESH BUT FAMILIAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kavel is a game that seems familiar but is in fact a truly unique and fresh matching experience. New gameplay ideas to challenge you with some of the play elements that you already know. Let yourself be surprised. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/f4cf8fc9dbeb8118586c633c2af2d4df.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>DESIGNED FOR LONGEVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to play, hard to master. A layered score system, designed to engage you time after time as you learn the subtleties of storming the leaderboards. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/5ac0dd2b1c76030e4fe8521d11f7094f.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>ACHIEVEMENTS AND LEADERBOARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full integration of achievements and leaderboards. Carefully designed achievements to playfully teach and surprise you. Approaching play from new perspectives. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/cfb61ab358ed8527b30de355e7728efe.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>BEAUTIFUL COLOR PALETTES - INCLUDING DARK MODE PALETTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style Kavel the way you like, all themes are created and perfected for an optimal play experience. Dip your finger in the paint and let's go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/18b20770e83af3e0e5404408606b955c.poster.avif?t=1770070025\" width=616 height=517 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/18b20770e83af3e0e5404408606b955c.webm?t=1770070025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/1cfda338162a5d52cfa33766087dd4d5.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>PLAYFUL DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal design language for optimal play experience. Instantly take in the puzzle board for split second decisions. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/338318cf7340fe6ae125b3fa50cc216e.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>BESPOKE AUDIO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and lively audio experience that really pops. With music specially composed for Kavel to support the game's varied modes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/f4cf8fc9dbeb8118586c633c2af2d4df.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>OPTIMIZED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs smoothly on every device. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414530/extras/5ac0dd2b1c76030e4fe8521d11f7094f.webp?t=1770070025\" width=12 height=12 /></span>COLORBLIND-FRIENDLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not rely on color and is playable with any form of color blindness. Further includes multiple color palettes optimized for any form of color blindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kavel was humbly inspired by games I love such as Tetris, Lumines and Bejeweled (Blitz)</i></p>","developers":["Jerry Verhoeven"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.aka